==Trivia==
*He appears to be based on the [[wikipedia:Northern puffer|northern puffer]], which has a white belly like Mr. Puffington. His green coloration could also be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Green pufferfish|green pufferfish]] or the [[wikipedia: Dichotomyctere nigroviridis|green spotted puffer]].
*His Japanese name, フグ太くん Fuguta-kun, is a combination of フグ ''fugu'', meaning "pufferfish", 太 ''ta'', meaning "thick", and くん ''-kun'', an informal honorific primarily used with boys' names and between peers and friends.
*His Japanese name and description reference the character Masuo Fuguta from [[wikipedia:Sazae-san|''Sazae-san'']], a salaryman well known for having moved in with his wife Sazae after marrying her.
*He has the longest attack cycle and highest knockback count of all [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]].

